      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:ot.amos.bohairic_ed:02",
      "dialect": "bohairic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲉⲓⲉϣⲱϥ ⲛⲛⲓⲧⲱⲟⲩ ⲛⲉⲙⲛⲓⲕⲁⲗⲁⲙⲫⲟ ⲟⲩⲟϩ ⲡⲟⲩⲥⲓⲙ ⲧⲏⲣϥ ⲉⲓⲉ**ⲧϣⲟⲩⲓⲟ**ϥ ⲉⲓⲉⲭⲱ ⲛϩⲁⲛⲓⲁⲣⲱⲟⲩ ⲉϩⲁⲛⲛⲏⲥⲟⲥ ⲟⲩⲟϩ ϩⲁⲛϩⲉⲗⲟⲥ ⲉⲓⲉⲧϣⲟⲩⲓⲱⲟⲩ .",
      "english": "I will make desolate mountains and hills, and will dry up all their grass; and I will make the rivers islands, and dry up the pools.",
      "source": "23_Isaias_42",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:ot.isa.bohairic_ed:42",
      "dialect": "bohairic"
